{"notice_id":24263362,"sections":[{"kind":"SettledContract","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"CON-0001","values":[{"field_id":"BT-145-Contract","ordinal":0,"type":"date","value":"2024-07-12"},{"field_id":"BT-150-Contract","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"1"},{"field_id":"BT-3202-Contract","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"TEN-0001"},{"field_id":"BT-721-Contract","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Proklima GmbH, 90411 Nürnberg"},{"field_id":"OPT-316-Contract","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"contract","type":"id","value":"CON-0001"}]},{"kind":"Lot","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"LOT-0001","values":[{"field_id":"BT-01(c)-Procedure","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"vob-a-eu"},{"field_id":"BT-115-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":1},{"field_id":"BT-137-Lot","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"Lot","type":"id","value":"LOT-0001"},{"field_id":"BT-21-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Eichsfeld Gymnasium Duderstadt, Baulogistik/-einrichtung und unterstützende Leistungen"},{"field_id":"BT-22-Lot","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"internalID","type":"id","value":"2404031"},{"code":"works","field_id":"BT-23-Lot","list":"contract-nature","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-24-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Baulogistikleistungen:\n- Stellung und Vorhaltung von Büro- / Materialcontainern, Sanitäreinrichtung, etc.\n- Kleinere Behelfsmaßnahmen\n- Stellung und Vorhaltung von Bauaufzügen\n- Baureinigungs- und Winterdienstleistungen"},{"field_id":"BT-58-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":0},{"code":"no-eu-funds","field_id":"BT-60-Lot","list":"eu-funded","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"false","field_id":"BT-717-Lot","list":"cvd-scope","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"none","field_id":"BT-765-Lot","list":"framework-agreement","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"none","field_id":"BT-766-Lot","list":"dps-usage","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-767-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":0},{"code":"circ-econ","field_id":"BT-774-Lot","list":"environmental-impact","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"clim-adapt","field_id":"BT-774-Lot","list":"environmental-impact","ordinal":1,"type":"code"},{"code":"clim-mitig","field_id":"BT-774-Lot","list":"environmental-impact","ordinal":2,"type":"code"},{"code":"pollu-prev","field_id":"BT-774-Lot","list":"environmental-impact","ordinal":3,"type":"code"},{"code":"water-mar","field_id":"BT-774-Lot","list":"environmental-impact","ordinal":4,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-99-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Genaue Angaben zu den Fristen für die Einlegung von Rechtsbehelfen:\nGemäß § 160 Abs. 1 GWB leitet die Vergabekammer ein Nachprüfungsverfahren nur auf Antrag ein.\nDer Antrag ist unzulässig, soweit der Antragsteller den geltend gemachten Verstoß gegen Vergabevorschriften vor Einreichen des Nachprüfungsantrags erkannt und gegenüber dem Auftraggeber nicht innerhalb einer Frist von 10 Kalendertagen gerügt hat; der Ablauf der Frist nach § 134 Absatz 2 bleibt unberührt (§ 160 Abs. 3 Nr. 1 GWB).\nDer Nachprüfungsantrag ist gemäß § 160 Abs. 3 Nr. 2 GWB ebenfalls unzulässig, soweit Verstöße gegen Vergabevorschriften, die aufgrund der Bekanntmachung erkennbar sind, nicht spätestens bis zum Ablauf der in der Bekanntmachung benannten Frist zur Bewerbung oder zur Angebotsabgabe gegenüber dem Auftraggeber gerügt werden.\nDer Vergabenachprüfungsantrag ist ferner nach § 160 Abs. 3 Nr. 3 GWB unzulässig, soweit Verstöße gegen Vergabevorschriften, die erst in den Vergabeunterlagen erkennbar sind, nicht spätestens bis zum Ablauf der Frist zur Bewerbung oder zur Angebotsabgabe gegenüber dem Auftraggeber gerügt werden. Der Nachprüfungsantrag ist gemäß § 160 Abs. 3 Nr. 4 GWB schließlich dann unzulässig, soweit mehr als 15 Kalendertage nach Eingang der Mitteilung des Auftraggebers, einer Rüge nicht abhelfen zu wollen, vergangen sind. Für die weiteren Voraussetzungen der Zulässigkeit wird auf §§ 160 und 161 GWB verwiesen."},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-AddInfo","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"ORG-0002"},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-ReviewInfo","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"organization","type":"id","value":"ORG-0003"},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-ReviewOrg","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"organization","type":"id","value":"ORG-0004"}]},{"kind":"ContractingParty","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"ND-ContractingParty#0","values":[{"code":"gen-pub","field_id":"BT-10-Procedure-Buyer","list":"authority-activity","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"la","field_id":"BT-11-Procedure-Buyer","list":"buyer-legal-type","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"OPT-300-Procedure-Buyer","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"ORG-0001"}]},{"kind":"LocalLegalBasisWithID","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"ND-LocalLegalBasisWithID#0","values":[{"field_id":"BT-01(c)-Procedure","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"vob-a-eu"}]},{"kind":"LotAwardCriterion","parent_section_id":"LOT-0001","section_id":"ND-LotAwardCriterion#0","values":[{"code":"price","field_id":"BT-539-Lot","list":"award-criterion-type","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-734-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Preis"}]},{"kind":"LotAwardCriterionParameter","parent_section_id":"ND-LotAwardCriterion#0","section_id":"ND-LotAwardCriterionParameter#0","values":[{"field_id":"BT-541-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"number","unit":null,"value":100.0},{"code":"per-exa","field_id":"BT-5421-Lot","list":"number-weight","ordinal":0,"type":"code"}]},{"kind":"LotMainClassification","parent_section_id":"LOT-0001","section_id":"ND-LotMainClassification#0","values":[{"code":"45210000","field_id":"BT-262-Lot","ordinal":0,"scheme":"cpv","type":"classification"}]},{"kind":"LotPlacePerformance","parent_section_id":"LOT-0001","section_id